# Goblin Plate Mail: "When this Equipment enters, amass Goblins 1, then attach this Equipment to the amassed Army. Equipped
# creature gets +1/+0 and has menace. Equip {4}." On turn 1 Bot1 has no Army, so the amass makes a 0/0 Goblin Army token with one
# counter and the Plate Mail attaches to it: a 2/1 with menace, beside a Grizzly Bears that has neither. On turn 3 Equip {4} (paid
# with exactly four mana) moves it to the Bears, a 3/2 with menace, and the Army is a 1/1 again.

